E AX2006 955-import-absolute-path.ax:7:9-20 module-path-segment "`/etc/passwd` is a file path, not a module-path segment" #"a module-path segment is a name: `/` is not part of one" !"a segment carrying `/` re-anchors the search directory it is concatenated onto, so the import resolves outside the project" ?"write the module's dotted name - `Sys.Platform`, not `Sys/Platform` - and put the directory holding it on `AXIOM_PATH` or beside the entry file; a module name is resolved against the search directories, never used as a path of its own"
